interface.signature:
POST /api/chat
Request Body: {
  "user_id": "telegram_12345",    // Platform-prefixed user ID
  "platform": "telegram",
  "message": "Should I buy AAPL?",
  "conversation_id": null          // Optional conversation ID
}
Response (200 OK): {
  "conversation_id": "conv_abc123",
  "status": "processing" | "completed" | "error",
  "message": null                  // For synchronous responses
}
Errors: 400 (invalid input), 500 (internal error), 503 (service unavailable)
